{"No-ember header right-align broken: The PR changes .panel alignment to rely on flexbox (margin-left:auto/order), but the Rails fallback header wraps .panel inside a Bootstrap v2 .row which is float-based (not a flex container). Therefore .panel is not a flex item in that path and will no longer right-align on noscript and /no_ember pages.": 0.7147703766822815, "order mixin ordinal-group off-by-one: The order mixin passes $val directly to -webkit-box-ordinal-group and -moz-box-ordinal-group, but the old flexbox spec uses 1-based indexing (default: 1) while the standard order property is 0-based (default: 0). This causes incorrect element ordering in older browsers.": 0.8643960952758789}